      considerations: [
        'Be the first to reach 100 points by bidding, melding, and taking tricks. Each hand: auction to name trump, meld for points, then play 15 tricks. Bid winner must make their contract (meld plus trick points) or lose the bid amount.',
        "Dealer deals 15 cards to each player and 3 to the kitty. Player to dealer's left opens bidding (minimum 20, or 19 if dealer); bids increase by 1. With meld, opening player must bid or pass passes obligation. Highest bidder takes the kitty, declares trump, and all three show melds. Bid winner discards 3 cards to reduce to 15; melds return to hands. High bidder leads; follow suit when possible, trump when void. Must take at least one trick to count meld. Trick points plus bid winner's three discards total 25; bidder must meet contract or score minus the bid.",
        '3 players',
        '15 cards each, 3-card kitty',
